  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The data set was developed to investigate seasonal, inter-annual, and spatial variability in Hudson Bay ringed seal (Phoca hispida) feeding ecology using stable isotope analysis on samples collected from Sanikiluaq and Arviat, Nunavut. Variability in feeding ecology was interpreted in the context of current environmental and ecological changes occurring in Hudson Bay."
